U|                         Why did it explode. I've worked the                        
U|                         numbers over and over, presuming the                       
U|                         worst possible conditions in an RBMK                       
U|                         reactor, and I get the same answer                         
U|                         every time.                                                
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         Which is?                                                  
O|
C|                                     KHOMYUK                                        
U|                         It's not possible.                                         
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         And yet.                                                   
O|
N|            They sit in silence for a moment. Then:                                 
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         I've spoken to the director of your                        
U|                         institute. He says you're difficult                        
U|                         and brutally stubborn.                                     
P|                               (beat)                                               
U|                         Which I'm hoping for.                                      
O|
N|            He takes her page of calculations.                                      
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         You're not going to solve this here.                       
U|                         Not on paper.                                              
N|            She leans forward. Activated. Yes... a hunt. A chase. For               
N|            the truth.                                                              
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         I'm authorizing you to conduct a full                      
U|                         inquiry. Begin in Moscow. Hospital                         
U|                         Number 6. Talk to everyone who was in                      
U|                         the control room that night--                              
