N|            papers and rises to leave. Then:                                        
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         And Khomyuk...                                             
O|
O|
O|                                                                     20.            
O|
N|            She turns back. He makes a subtle gesture around himself, as            
N|            in-- "the system around us is watching... listening..."                 
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         Be careful.                                                
