O|
S|       326  EXT. REACTOR SITE - DAY                                       326       
O|
N|            BUSES pull up to the site, just fifty meters or so away from            
N|            the blown-open reactor building.                                        
N|            The miners get out... and stare in shock at the sight in                
N|            front of them. Soldiers hand out GAS MASKS to them as they              
N|            file off the bus.                                                       
O|
C|                                     MINER                                          
U|                         Where do we need to go?                                    
O|
O|
O|                                                                     27.            
O|
C|                                     SOLDIER                                        
U|                         Straight ahead.                                            
O|
N|            The miners stumble forward. This is far from a mine. They're            
N|            unsure what they're doing or where they're supposed to be.              
O|
S|       327  INT. MOBILE OFFICE - MOMENTS LATER                            327       
O|
N|            Legasov sits with Shcherbina. A map of the power plant on               
N|            the small table in front of them.                                       
O|
N|            Legasov smokes. Worried.                                                
O|
C|                                     SHCHERBINA                                     
U|                         What.                                                      
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         I'm not good at this, Boris.                               
P|                               (beat)                                               
U|                         The lying.                                                 
C|                                     SHCHERBINA                                     
U|                         Have you ever spent time with miners?                      
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         No.                                                        
O|
