N|            Shcherbina nods. The soldier backs away, and GLUKHOV enters,            
N|            gas mask in hand. He sits himself down unceremoniously, and             
N|            drops the gas mask on the table. Gestures at it.                        
O|
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
U|                         Do these work?                                             
