O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         The core of the nuclear reactor,                           
U|                         which is melting down.                                     
O|
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
P|                               (melting down?)                                      
U|                         What. Like-- ?                                             
O|
N|            He makes a dropping gesture.                                            
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         Essentially.                                               
O|
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
U|                         Is it going to fall on us?                                 
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
