O|
N|            Glukhov takes a long drag on his cigarette. Staring                     
N|            carefully at Legasov. Then:                                             
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
U|                         Dimensions?                                                
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
P|                               (points at the map)                                  
U|                         You'll break ground here, tunnel 150                       
U|                         metres to here, and then excavate                          
