O|
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
U|                         We'll need more men. At least four                         
U|                         hundred. And we'll have to work                            
U|                         around the clock.                                          
P|                               (beat)                                               
U|                         How deep do you want this tunnel? Six                      
U|                         metres?                                                    
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
