O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         For your protection. At that depth,                        
U|                         you will be shielded from much of the                      
U|                         radiation.                                                 
O|
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
U|                         The entrance to the tunnel won't be                        
U|                         twelve metres down.                                        
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         No.                                                        
O|
C|                                     GLUKHOV                                        
