U|                         right now.                                                 
O|
C|                                     LEGASOV                                        
U|                         No. We're not.                                             
O|
N|            Ah. So this is the situation.                                           
O|
C|                                     SHCHERBINA                                     
U|                         We have some equipment here on site,                       
U|                         but more will arrive by midnight. You                      
U|                         can start in the morning.                                  
