O|
S|       333  INT. ISOLATION ROOM - CONTINUOUS                              333       
O|
N,G|            We're on Vasily's side of the TRANSPARENT CURTAIN. Through              
N,G|            the plastic, we see the DOOR open.                                      
O|
N|            Lyudmilla approaches. Then stops just on the other side of              
N|            the plastic.                                                            
O|
O|
O|                                                                     36.            
O|
C|                                     VASILY                                         
U|                         Lyusya?                                                    
O|
